diff --git a/SOLUTION.md b/SOLUTION.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f6bc3f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/SOLUTION.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# SOLUTION
+
+Two bugs in `lrucache/cache.py`:
+
+1. **`get` did not count as a "use".** It read the entry out of the
+   `OrderedDict` but never moved it to the end, so the recency order only ever
+   reflected insertions. A key that was read repeatedly could still be the next
+   one evicted. Fixed by calling `move_to_end(key)` on a successful (non-expired)
+   lookup.
+
+2. **`put` evicted on every insert once full, even for existing keys.** The
+   capacity check ran before looking at whether the key was already present, so
+   updating a key in a full cache dropped the least-recently-used *other* entry
+   and left the cache under capacity. Fixed by only evicting when the key is not
+   already in the cache.
